# EduTrack — Student Management System

A simple student management web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Student registration and management
- Attendance tracking
- Marks and grades management
- Course and department management
- Fee tracking
- Reports and CSV export
- Dashboard with dark mode
- LocalStorage data saving

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- LocalStorage
- GitHub Pages

## Live Demo
https://anjanabejjanki07.github.io/EduTrack-Student-Management-System/

## Run Locally
1. Clone this repository.
2. Open `index.html` in your browser.

## Data Storage
Student data is stored in the browser's LocalStorage. Data is not automatically shared between users or devices.

